071a6902cdc3b514e03476f95aff99beccef26a0f4a6f2e65df9047159","logical_entry_identity":"74187abb6119a53136a33aadb17c0f3b5bee1d0f6b752439717e0f7ecae12c65","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"burnt tree","source_tag":"entity name","target":"烧焦的树"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4247eb3ddb884aa1e59fc244910f329115639bdf482ceedcdf074bd219f06c39","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2db5beb447ce073cf340fb7bd9d3457bfe5bf1ae86eb7044f78798d01fff464","logical_entry_identity":"3c1c435c0291ec3449a62d61dd4cb8b81ef99e7e2d07f8cc5423e8877f851e07","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Dark Queen shall reign!","source_tag":"_t","target":"黑暗女王将君临天下！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a523652fd34bf584a9f0a6da27e43fa3a00b147f2eb2d8f12311ce2dd69e8307","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2dda0fa71be0a7be211165b76513e865583be1f20faee23033411b9f7a2369d","logical_entry_identity":"0b1ca889068306db331dcd8e003fef833286cf8db916406cb83de13c0d1bb902","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Master Marksman","source_tag":"talent name","target":"射击精通"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"581b22e1477035222e4a5a7793a2695e9cabc4d61c06a4e84220d0d357c39b85","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2e139ec0ae96e4588edf49ba0ef30124ca670c763aec25d73e1665eab86837e","logical_entry_identity":"f0c60a3a2b9cb9132fff9f48458dc8eeacc4488881d1301aed92f99f95b81546","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Customize Appearance","source_tag":"_t","target":"自定义外形"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e30540a089ee619af54e84d58311c4d700265fe8eb311fd931fe806d507dbb14","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2e781e786aa460c0242f6bcbab53bffe0f2674245e86ab2dc534e485ca353c9","logical_entry_identity":"f1e3f6989a1757a2c848e02b758ccece44b47b3b7882054afddfb3e0ae9bf877","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#Clinician Korbek's experimental notes part two#{normal}#\n\nI have begun work on several of the females. They are being kept in a coma for the duration of the experiments - it's far better that way. Initially I have subjected them to very high levels of wild infusion and arcane regeneration fields, whilst also keeping a direct feed into their stomachs high in protein. Corrupted blood is being pumped into their ovaries with a temporal acceleration field surrounding them. The leaders of each Pride have donated their seed for use in the experiments.\n\nInitial results have mostly been immensely successful. Body mass has grown significantly, especially in the abdominal region. One has even begun developing extra ovaries and sexual organs. I have managed to increase their fertility immensely, and the stimulated foetal growth rate means that new orcs take only eight weeks from conception to birth. The young also seem to be progressing in their development at a very advanced pace, with particularly accelerated muscle development.\n\nSome females have died during the procedures. I can only presume these were the weaker subjects, but it is a tragic loss regardless.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#巫医库贝克的实验报告：二#{normal}#\n\n我已经对几名雌性展开了实验。在实验期间她们一直处于昏迷状态——那样会好得多。起初我让她们承受了极高剂量的野性纹身与奥术再生力场，同时直接向她们的胃中注入高蛋白营养。在笼罩她们的时间加速力场下，堕落之血被泵入她们的卵巢。各个兽人部落的领袖都献出了自己的种子用于实验。\n\n初步结果大多取得了极其巨大的成功。受试体的体重显著增加，尤其是腹部区域。其中一人甚至开始发育出额外的卵巢与生殖器官。我成功大幅提升了她们的生育能力，受刺激的胎儿生长速度意味着新兽人从受孕到出生只需短短八周。幼体的发育速度也快得出奇，尤其是肌肉发育格外迅速。\n\n在实验过程中有几名雌性死亡。我只能推断她们是体质较弱的受试体，但无论如何这都是惨痛的损失。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c70b5133644e5d7f83284dab8d167efdbc9a9ca969e05ac163b79bd780a1f0a4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2e87f26a5a00ce2228f3dd15e6d31555fb561a90de077e0166a3bf365718409","logical_entry_identity":"c905b1220b9d84aff8d24c1f19c1457693503d6fa38dd08b7f8bb28aed17a906","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shows the target the madness of the void.  Each turn for 6 turns the target must make a mental save or suffer %0.2f mind damage as well as resource damage (based off the mind damage and nature of the resource).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"向目标展示虚空的疯狂。在接下来的 6 回合中，目标每回合都必须进行一次精神豁免，否则将受到 %0.2f 点精神伤害，并损失一定资源值；资源损失量取决于精神伤害和资源类型。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"862b0b6001384387527ec66e62d7e527e5a62d0305fab55f1c76c99b47990ef0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2ea9954e9199f42555f5c76b00eab767d17d940470e2afc231d0d47ca226084","logical_entry_identity":"11190c1907007907d4b039ed85fe7a6d8df46c20084bc5017fa3424c04a72010","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your cunning manipulations allow you to use charms (wands, totems and torques) more efficiently, reducing their cooldowns by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你灵活的头脑，使你可以更加有效的使用饰品（魔杖、图腾和项圈），减少 %d%% 饰品的冷却时间。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7633924a3d8b8f4b5a5fb3ea2d71c8bde16b574f321ebebd856d62f9a3967627","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2ebc684605e19842db3a0d7446f8235980fea4aef097c7ee77c608bdbfcd282","logical_entry_identity":"80304c56c291e064534336fd64b12f8bbbabfa1b9dbeaa22d3edbf43607ede29","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have become a keen observer in your travels. Each kill gives you %d%% more experience.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你在旅途中逐渐成长为一个敏锐的观察者，杀死敌人获得 %d%% 更多经验值。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"24846741e6d64b31e697617b6d9206f3c567584493f50b5940d5ea4735f7b5dd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2edd8d72ed87ffadfedbd8389c479f8b67e2de1ad06fd9f1d61023c70cfcb2d","logical_entry_identity":"addf5bbde782eb9c1521cff14ffc318254dee99fe2b1730257dc5a94df927c2a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ritch impaler","source_tag":"entity name","target":"锋刺里奇"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f2e6aa2407a03fc95381de0cf4b1a367291ec268a35463f9d206291c07334640","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b2f1907e13f30203f067521d89f024de8c386e7be9351aa75b48b25701f387e3","logical_entry_identity":"3d2adf9fad30b24219aa52685159539e74589df6fa9e69fbd8f7e50caa959e39","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"scoundrel","source_tag":"talent type","target":"街头格斗"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b59d